' Shared PlantUML style for the Supermarket Inventory Tracking System SAD.
' Included by every diagram with:  !include style.puml
'
' This file is an include, not a diagram: it carries no start directive, so the
' render script and the lint skip it. Every real diagram pulls in these settings so
' colour, font and arrow styling stay identical across authors and views.

skinparam backgroundColor white
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName Serif
skinparam defaultFontSize 12
skinparam ArrowColor #334155
skinparam ArrowFontColor #334155
skinparam ComponentBorderColor #475569
skinparam ComponentBackgroundColor #f8fafc
skinparam InterfaceBorderColor #475569
skinparam DatabaseBorderColor #475569
skinparam QueueBorderColor #475569
skinparam NodeBorderColor #475569
skinparam NoteBorderColor #64748b
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #f8fafc

' Shared colour vocabulary. Use these exact fills so the same kind of element
' reads the same way in every view:
'   #dae8fc  external system / boundary element
'   #d5e8d4  store-side runtime element
'   #fff2cc  distribution-center runtime element
'   #e1d5e7  persistent store
